{"unit_id":"tag:06YS:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。对任意复形（complex）<MATH_0002>，存在 <MATH_0003>-平坦（flat）复形（complex）<MATH_0004>，其各项（terms）为平坦（flat）的 <MATH_0005>-模（modules），并存在拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）<MATH_0006>，它逐项（termwise）满射（surjective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"termwise","target_term":"逐项"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"给定及分解复形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"复形及各项平坦性"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项","context":"复形各项"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数模"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"分解映射"},{"source_term":"termwise","target_term":"逐项","context":"映射各项性质"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"逐项满射性"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06YS:proof","translation":"选取图式（diagram），如引理 <REF_0001> 所述。每个复形（complex）<MATH_0001> 都是由平坦模（flat modules）组成的上有界（bounded above）复形（complex），见《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0002>。因此 <MATH_0002> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）的，见引理 <REF_0003>。从而 <MATH_0003> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）的，见引理 <REF_0004>。诱导映射（induced map）\n<MATH_0004>\n由构造为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）且逐项（termwise）满射（surjective）。引理 <REF_0005> 的性质 (3) 表明 <MATH_0005> 是平坦模（flat modules）的直和（direct sum），因而平坦（flat），这证明了最后的断言。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"flat modules","target_term":"平坦模"},{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"induced map","target_term":"诱导映射"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"termwise","target_term":"逐项"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat modules","target_term":"平坦模"},{"source_term":"direct sum","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式","context":"构造图式"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"分解复形"},{"source_term":"flat modules","target_term":"平坦模","context":"分解各项"},{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界","context":"构造的有界性"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"分解复形性质"},{"source_term":"induced map","target_term":"诱导映射","context":"余极限上的映射"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"分解映射性质"},{"source_term":"termwise","target_term":"逐项","context":"映射各项性质"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"分解映射满射性"},{"source_term":"direct sum","target_term":"直和","context":"各项的直和结构"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"各项平坦性"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06YT:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）复形（complexes）的拟同构（quasi-isomorphism），这些复形由 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）组成。对每个复形（complex）<MATH_0004>（由 <MATH_0005>-模（modules）组成），诱导映射（induced map）\n<MATH_0006>\n为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"induced map","target_term":"诱导映射"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"张量因子性质"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"拟同构两端"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"张量前后拟同构"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"任意张量因子"},{"source_term":"induced map","target_term":"诱导映射","context":"张量诱导映射"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06YT:proof","translation":"选取拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）<MATH_0001>，其中 <MATH_0002> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）复形（complex），见引理 <REF_0001>。考虑交换图式（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0003>\n由引理 <REF_0002>，竖直的（vertical）箭头（arrows）和顶部水平的（horizontal）箭头（arrow）都是拟同构（quasi-isomorphisms），因此结论得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图式"},{"source_term":"vertical","target_term":"竖直的"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平的"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphisms","target_term":"拟同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"分解映射"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"分解复形性质"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"分解复形"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图式","context":"张量比较图式"},{"source_term":"vertical","target_term":"竖直的","context":"图式箭头方向"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头","context":"图式中的箭头"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平的","context":"图式箭头方向"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头","context":"顶部箭头"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphisms","target_term":"拟同构","context":"图式箭头性质"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06YL:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为 <MATH_0003> 的对象（object）。选取 K-平坦（K-flat）分解（resolution）<MATH_0004>，见引理 <REF_0001>。由引理 <REF_0002>，得到三角范畴（triangulated categories）的正合（exact）函子（functor）\n<MATH_0005>\n由引理 <REF_0003>，这个函子（functor）诱导函子（functor）<MATH_0006>，仅仅因为 <MATH_0007> 是 <MATH_0008> 关于拟同构（quasi-isomorphisms）的局部化（localization）。由于 <MATH_0009>-平坦（flat）分解（resolutions）的范畴（category）（这些分解针对 <MATH_0010>）余滤过（cofiltered），并且有引理 <REF_0004>，所得函子（functor）（在同构（isomorphism）意义下）不依赖于 <MATH_0011> 的选取。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"resolution","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"triangulated categories","target_term":"三角范畴"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphisms","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"resolutions","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"cofiltered","target_term":"余滤过"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"导出范畴对象"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"分解性质"},{"source_term":"resolution","target_term":"分解","context":"选取的分解"},{"source_term":"triangulated categories","target_term":"三角范畴","context":"函子所在范畴"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"三角函子正合性"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"导出张量函子"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphisms","target_term":"拟同构","context":"局部化映射类"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化","context":"导出范畴的定义"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"分解复形性质"},{"source_term":"resolutions","target_term":"分解","context":"分解范畴对象"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"分解范畴"},{"source_term":"cofiltered","target_term":"余滤过","context":"分解范畴性质"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"函子独立性"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06YU:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为 <MATH_0003> 的对象（object）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>导出张量积（derived tensor product）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\n<MATH_0004>\n是上面描述的三角范畴（triangulated categories）的正合（exact）函子（functor）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"derived tensor product","target_term":"导出张量积"},{"source_term":"triangulated categories","target_term":"三角范畴"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"导出范畴对象"},{"source_term":"derived tensor product","target_term":"导出张量积","context":"定义的函子"},{"source_term":"triangulated categories","target_term":"三角范畴","context":"函子所在范畴"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"函子正合性"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"导出张量函子"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06YL:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由我们的显式构造可见，存在典范同构（canonical isomorphism）\n<MATH_0001>\n对 <MATH_0002> 和 <MATH_0003>（在 <MATH_0004> 中）均如此。这里使用《代数续论（More on Algebra）》第 <REF_0001> 节给出的符号规则（sign rules）。因此，当写出\n<MATH_0005>\n时，我们通常不区分是用哪个变量（variable）来定义导出张量积（derived tensor product）的。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"canonical isomorphism","target_term":"典范同构"},{"source_term":"More on Algebra","target_term":"代数续论"},{"source_term":"sign rules","target_term":"符号规则"},{"source_term":"variable","target_term":"变量"},{"source_term":"derived tensor product","target_term":"导出张量积"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"canonical isomorphism","target_term":"典范同构","context":"导出张量交换同构"},{"source_term":"More on Algebra","target_term":"代数续论","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"sign rules","target_term":"符号规则","context":"张量交换符号"},{"source_term":"variable","target_term":"变量","context":"用作分解的变量"},{"source_term":"derived tensor product","target_term":"导出张量积","context":"分解选取的独立性"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08FF:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003> 为 <MATH_0004>-模（modules）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>挠层（Tor）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，针对 <MATH_0005> 和 <MATH_0006>，由公式（formula）\n<MATH_0007>\n定义，其中导出张量积（derived tensor product）按上文定义。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"Tor","target_term":"挠层"},{"source_term":"formula","target_term":"公式"},{"source_term":"derived tensor product","target_term":"导出张量积"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"两个系数模"},{"source_term":"Tor","target_term":"挠层","context":"层范畴中的 Tor"},{"source_term":"formula","target_term":"公式","context":"Tor 定义公式"},{"source_term":"derived tensor product","target_term":"导出张量积","context":"定义中的导出运算"}],"notes":[]}
